# NOTE: the Vercel CLI appended a bare `.env*» here on first link. That glob
# overrode the `!.env.example» negation above — a later gitignore pattern wins —
# so it silently dropped .env.example from version control. The explicit entries
# in the "Environment / secrets" block already cover .env and .env.local, which
# is all the CLI actually needed. Do not re-add a wildcard here.
